==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 5.33~16 seconds<sup>160f~480f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
**200 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.67~6.67 seconds<sup>20f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage introduces Gory Groom, the main boss of this event. Since he is at a low magnification, any [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] or decent damage dealing cat will do. Bringing meatshields may also be needed, but are likely not necessary. However, do take note of Gory Groom's [[Base Destroyer]] ability, which should likely be more prominent in later stages.

